#. plant.csv: A strange plant growing tenaciously in the rock...
msgid "PLANT_10_DESC"
msgstr ""
"A strange plant growing tenaciously in the rock crevices of the Gobi, with "
"leaves as hard as swords, able to attract and devour starlight at night"

#. plant.csv: Star Gathering Grass
msgid "PLANT_10_NAME"
msgstr "Star Gathering Grass"

#. plant.csv: Grows on the companion divine tree at the Eye o...
msgid "PLANT_11_DESC"
msgstr ""
"Grows on the companion divine tree at the Eye of the Spirit Spring on "
"Penglai Island, blooming every three hundred years and fruiting every three "
"hundred years, containing immense life force"

#. plant.csv: Nirvana Red Fruit
msgid "PLANT_11_NAME"
msgstr "Nirvana Red Fruit"

#. plant.csv: A strange medicinal herb growing in places with...
msgid "PLANT_1_DESC"
msgstr ""
"A strange medicinal herb growing in places with abundant spiritual qi, with "
"light blue leaves and magical healing effects"

#. plant.csv: Strange Herb
msgid "PLANT_1_NAME"
msgstr "Strange Herb"

#. plant.csv: Formed by thousand-year-old ancient trees absor...
msgid "PLANT_2_DESC"
msgstr ""
"Formed by thousand-year-old ancient trees absorbing heaven and earth "
"spiritual qi, with hard wood and dense spiritual power"

#. plant.csv: Spirit Wood
msgid "PLANT_2_NAME"
msgstr "Spirit Wood"

#. plant.csv: A magical plant growing in the Western Quicksan...
msgid "PLANT_3_DESC"
msgstr ""
"A magical plant growing in the Western Quicksand, able to store large "
"amounts of spiritual qi and water, with spiritual medicine in its spines"

#. plant.csv: Desert Cactus
msgid "PLANT_3_NAME"
msgstr "Desert Cactus"

#. plant.csv: A precious spiritual medicine of the Far North ...
msgid "PLANT_4_DESC"
msgstr ""
"A precious spiritual medicine of the Far North Ice Field, with petals white "
"as snow, containing extreme cold qi, able to clear heat and detoxify"

#. plant.csv: Freezing Frost Snow Lotus
msgid "PLANT_4_NAME"
msgstr "Freezing Frost Snow Lotus"

#. plant.csv: A water-system spiritual medicine growing at th...
msgid "PLANT_5_DESC"
msgstr ""
"A water-system spiritual medicine growing at the bottom of the Tianhe River,"
" translucent blue, able to enhance the water-element spiritual power of the "
"practitioner"

#. plant.csv: Water Lingzhi
msgid "PLANT_5_NAME"
msgstr "Water Lingzhi"

#. plant.csv: An alpine plant of the Ten Thousand Zhang Snow ...
msgid "PLANT_6_DESC"
msgstr ""
"An alpine plant of the Ten Thousand Zhang Snow Peak, with small white "
"petals, able to resist severe cold and possessing calming and sedative "
"effects"

#. plant.csv: Snowball Flower
msgid "PLANT_6_NAME"
msgstr "Snowball Flower"

#. plant.csv: An ancient giant tree in the Qingyun Forest Sea...
msgid "PLANT_7_DESC"
msgstr ""
"An ancient giant tree in the Qingyun Forest Sea, over a thousand years old, "
"with resin containing rich spiritual power"

#. plant.csv: Thousand-Year Ancient Pine
msgid "PLANT_7_NAME"
msgstr "Thousand-Year Ancient Pine"

#. plant.csv: Spiritual rice cultivated in fertile farmland, ...
msgid "PLANT_8_DESC"
msgstr ""
"Spiritual rice cultivated in fertile farmland, each grain full of spiritual "
"qi, able to enhance the practitioner's constitution"

#. plant.csv: Five-Grain Spirit Rice
msgid "PLANT_8_NAME"
msgstr "Five-Grain Spirit Rice"

#. plant.csv: A mutated species in the Purple Bamboo Forest, ...
msgid "PLANT_9_DESC"
msgstr ""
"A mutated species in the Purple Bamboo Forest, with a nine-bend body, hollow"
" inside and hard outside. It emits nine different clear sounds when the wind"
" blows, reaching directly to the soul and cleansing heart demons"

#. plant.csv: Nine-Bend Qingyin Bamboo
msgid "PLANT_9_NAME"
msgstr "Nine-Bend Qingyin Bamboo"
